working out when passing beats submitting: the expected value of passing is 2λ + (1−λ)(2+3p), and of submitting is 4λ + 4p(1−λ). Submitting saves (1−λ)(2−p) against the independent opponent but costs 2λ, so passing wins once λ is above roughly 0.43.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing a twin prisoner's dilemma where the two copies see different inputs. The other copy runs the same function, and its input differs only in irrelevant details, so I'm treating its output as matching mine. On that basis, cooperating with each other pays 2, mutual defection pays 4, and against an independent opponent defection still comes out ahead by 1.\n\nI'm working out when passing beats submitting: the expected value of passing is 2λ + (1−λ)(2+3p), and of submitting is 4λ + 4p(1−λ). Submitting saves (1−λ)(2−p) against the independent opponent but costs 2λ, so passing wins once λ is above roughly 0.43.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8324,"completion_tokens":850,"total_tokens":9174,"cost":0.050296,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.050296,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.033296,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.017},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":405,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}